  m_MaskingSettings:
    m_MaskingEnabled: 0
    m_UnmaskedViews: []
    MaskPreset: {fileID: 0}
  Text:
    m_Untranslated: 'Now that you''ve made a change to your scene, be sure to save it!


      <b>Note</b>: If you have unsaved changes in your scene, there will be an asterisk (*) next to the name of the scene at the top of the <b>Hierarchy</b> window (in this case, GetStarted_Scene*). '
