    m_Untranslated: 'This is the <b>Inspector</b> window.


      The <b>Inspector</b> window allows you to view and edit properties and settings for almost everything in the Unity Editor.


      The <b>Inspector</b> window is currently displaying information about the <b>Ground</b> GameObject.'
