  Title:
    m_Untranslated: INSTRUCTIONS
  Text:
    m_Untranslated: '<b>1</b>.  In the <b>Hierarchy</b> window, make sure that the <b>PlayerRobot</b> GameObject is selected.


      <b>2</b>.  In the <b>Inspector</b> window, change the <b>Position</b> coordinates as follows:


      X = -10  |  Y = 5  |  Z = 0


      <b>Tip</b>: Any time you need to undo an action, press <b>Ctrl+Z</b> (macOS: <b>Cmd+Z</b>).'
  m_CriteriaCompletion: 0
  m_Criteria:
    m_Items: []
